WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.990
Have the class invent a reward that

2
00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:05.330
looks virtuous and breaks the task.

3
00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.580
Then separate the value picture from

4
00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:10.280
the policy picture on the board.

5
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.960
In the seminar: late credit, two

6
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.540
words you will not let them swap,

7
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.060
and a reward that backfires.

8
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.160
An action changes the world.

9
00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:25.210
The reward may arrive later, so the credit

10
00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.570
has to travel back along the path.

11
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.930
Value is how good it is to

12
00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:31.790
stand on a square.

13
00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.050
Policy is what to do there, and

14
00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.250
they are different pictures.

15
00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.350
Score spinning highly and a robot

16
00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.930
will spin in the puddle.

17
00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:44.720
The number is not an ethic.

18
00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:48.290
The values spread out from the charger.

19
00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.700
The policy then picks a

20
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.160
