21
00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:53.950
Quick check!

22
00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:58.050
A reward arrives after a path of actions.

23
00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:01.650
The hard part is which of these?

24
00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:05.630
Sending the credit back along the path.

25
00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:08.100
The earlier steps have to

26
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.160
