27
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.180
Two columns on the board:

28
00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:14.160
value, and policy.

29
00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:17.370
Students fill one row from the lab

30
00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:19.290
before you discuss a real system.

31
00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:21.320
Your turn.

32
00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:25.020
Are a value and a policy the same picture?

33
00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:27.140
Remember this.

34
00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:29.460
A reward that looks right

35
00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:31.640
