36
00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:34.550
Keep value and policy apart.

37
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.320
Try it in your next lecture.

38
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.980
Bring the wrong reward before the

39
00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:42.480
lab, and mark any paragraph that

40
00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.300
